          "data" => %{
            "object" => %{
              "body" =>
                "Good morning! I'll follow up on that to Josh. But please keep in mind our new SOP.\nThe SOP states: We pay cleaners 55% of the full price of a job. Payouts are completed in the mornings, approximately every other day, using Cash App. Given the time it takes to confirm a clean is satisfactory and initiate a charge to a customer, cleaners should expect a wait of 48-72 hours for Cash App payments to be paid. Additionally, if the job number is missing or inaccurate on a Cash App request, it will delay the payout by a minimum of 24 hours",
