          "data" => %{
            "object" => %{
              "body" =>
                "Good morning! I'll follow up on that with Josh. But please keep in mind \nThe SOP states:  We pay cleaners 52.5% of the full price of a job.  Payouts are completed in the mornings, approximately every other day, using Cash App.  Given the time it takes to confirm a clean is satisfactory and initiate a charge to a customer, cleaners should expect a wait of 48-72 hours for Cash App payments to be paid.  Additionally, if the job number is missing or inaccurate on a Cash App request, it will delay the payout by a minimum of 24 hours",
