      %Discussit.Events.Event{
        id: 2279,
        payload: %{
          "apiVersion" => "v3",
          "createdAt" => "2023-04-06T16:23:21.091Z",
          "data" => %{
            "object" => %{
              "body" =>
                "Not really. Overall it's in pretty good shape and we've done a lot of the cleaning already. The kitchen and appliances just need a bit of a spiff. The bathroom needs a good cleaning, as well as the windows. We would like the two ceiling fans to be dusted the two or three intake outlet, air vents cleaned, and the floors mopped. We just repainted so the walls and baseboards are fine. Both the built-in oven and microwave are clean the inside of the refrigerator should be wiped down but it's not bad.",
